  "question": {
    "text": "Calculate the angular frequency of the system shown in figure. Friction is absent everywhere and the threads, spring and pulleys are massless. Given that m<sub>A</sub> = m<sub>B</sub> = m.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0105_7f6d7197d422.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 131px; width: 200px;\" />"
